-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

                             RELEASE NOTE
                             ------------

This version of LogicBBS, is in NO WAY limited. You can use this version
for however long you may want to. Our main purposes of releasing a
LITE version are:

  1. Challenge all current used Bulletin board systems.
     You get this version for free, and we do not FORCE you to buy the
     FINAL product, when it is released. You have lot of time to
     investigate what you are about to use / buy.

  2. Programmers are not put into any dilemma, concerning programming
     a utility for the system. Whether they have a licens to use the system
     or not.


And with 2 months of testing both THEORETICALLY & IN PRACTICE. We do admit
the program is buggy. But this is limited to what we will accept for a
release.

What we KNOW is bugged.

   1. Some external doors used by Ami-Express , are in some way making 
      messageport structures corrupt. Reason : Unknown, Result: Your
      system will eventually go into a GURU!, second time you start
      an external door using msgports. We think this is our fault,
      because those doors normally works fine on the Ami-Express system.
      This concerns ONLY a few Ami-Express utilities.

   2. We have been trying to locate a very nasty bug in our filechecker.
      The event starts a tool to check a file ie. "LhA".
      The executable program may need parameters/options like -P5
      (priority 5), if you do this The system will halt, after finishing
      all files. If you exclude this -P5 option from "LhA" and only have
      the "LhA t", it works fine.
      We have only seen this problem with "LhA" so that is why our
      EXAMPLE is shown with "LhA".           We are working on this one!

   3. Hydra may do some breaks during transfer when receiving files.
      (A user uploading to the bbsystem).    Problem being solved!

LITE version means:

  1. Not fully documented.
     Some areas are not fully explained, but experienced sysops will
     easily figure out the tricks, making LogicBBS run at its best.

  2. Current number of tools for the LogicBBS system are not impressive.
     But people are working on this subject. We will see more utilities &
     doors in the near future.

  3. Parts of LogicBBS are still in Un-optimized stage. We call it Bulk-Code.

  4. NetMail, FidoNet  ARE MISSING!

  5. Minor small utilities, planned to be ready, are yet to come!



What you can expect of the FINAL, can only be >:

  1. Less bugs
  2. More utilities
  3. More features
